Canonical JS_RegisterClass/JS_Wrap inherited a field from parent JSHostClass
and exposed a child field on the same wrapper. Both resolved correctly.
This tests one basic inheritance semantics for Oolite's class hierarchy.
It does not prove JS_InitClass's special prototype, constructor, property
stub, resolve or finalizer conventions; original 101-symbol conversion
is still required.
